OL,3,AGavin and Stacey stars to feature in
OL,4,Afestive Julia Donaldson TV adaptation
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrydon, as Ghost, will be joined by
OL,7,FSheridan Smith and Alison Steadman, who
OL,8,Falso starred alongside him in the
OL,9,Fpopular sitcom, as well as Hammed
OL,10,FAnimashaun as Troll, Robyn Cara as
OL,11,FGirl, and Francesca Mills as the
OL,12,Fnarrator.
OL,14,FPrevious adaptations of Dame
OL,15,FDonaldson's books include The Gruffalo,
OL,16,FZog and The Scarecrows' Wedding, which
OL,17,Falso featured Brydon as scarecrow
OL,18,FReginald Rake.
